Package: reindeer
Type: Package
Title: Extend emuR for Speech Data in a Nordic Climate
Version: 0.8.4
Date: 2026-05-12
Authors@R: c(
    person("Fredrik", "Nylén", , "fredrik.nylen@umu.se", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-3373-0934"))
  )
Description: A systematic framework for speech corpora management that retains emuR compatibility, but provides
  expanded ability to store metadata associated with the recording, use the metadata to guide signal processing when appropriate, and support the user in future archiving and FAIR use
  by automating the creation, and continuous updating, of standard compliant metadata files for corpora.
